Copyright (c) 2026 Francis Townsend-Merino

goinfer is a pure-Go LLM runtime. It does not embed or distribute any model
weights itself — users supply their own open-weight checkpoints (safetensors,
GGUF, GPTQ, or AWQ) at runtime, under whatever license those checkpoints carry.

